# Association Timeline Determination

This scope calculates the end dates for the preparatory and transitional stages of the Association based on a starting date.
```catala
declaration scope AssociationTimeline:
  input start_date content date
  output prep_end content date
  output trans_end content date
```
The preparatory stage must last five years.
```catala
scope AssociationTimeline:
  date round down
  definition prep_end equals start_date + 5 year
  definition trans_end equals start_date + 12 year
```